                    Warren Christopher, 1977–1980, Lot 81D113, Box 9, Memos from WMC to
                    Offices/Bureaus—1979. Confidential. John King, Nimetz’ Special Assistant,
                    initialed for Nimetz.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d71-f2" n="2" xml:id="d71-f2-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed is telegram 3713 from USUN, September 11, which reported
                    that UN efforts had failed to make progress on the Cyprus negotiations.</p>
            </note>
